{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"異部宗輪論校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"一．是書校歷三週．一譯校．二類校．三刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"二．譯校凡用三本。（一）藏文本法行等譯異部宗輪論．校註略稱藏本。（二）後秦鳩","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"摩羅什譯十八部論．畧稱秦本。（三）陳真諦譯部執異論．略稱陳本。三本對勘今","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"譯．文句歧異有資尋討者．悉爲註出曰．某本雲雲。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"三．類校用巴利文本說事論．校註略稱南傳。部執對勘今譯互有同異者．悉爲註出","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"曰．南傳雲雲。所見原書章節．亦附註備考。如註（二·一○）．卽原書第二章第十","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"節．餘皆例知。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"四．刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對勘麗刻訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．今依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"五．校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"（一）藏本異部宗輪論．gshun%-lugs-kyibye-bragbkod-pah!ih!khor-lo．康熙版丹","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"珠．經解部u字函．一六八頁下至一七六頁下。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"（二）秦本十八部論．","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"（三）陳本部執異論．以上二種用日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"（四）南傳說事論Katha^-vatthu．台勞爾氏A．C．Taylor．校刊本．一八九四――","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"九七年．倫敦版。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"（五）本書南宋刻麗刻．悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本之","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_220_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_220","text":"校註。","sortOrder":19}],"overrides":{}}